### Contoh request untuk ekstensi "REST Client" (humao.rest-client). Klik "Send Request".
@base = http://localhost:8788

### Log masuk sebagai pemilik (akaun demo)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@campusos.io", "password": "password123" }

### Overview pengurusan
GET {{base}}/v1/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Senarai guru (cari "chemistry")
GET {{base}}/v1/teachers?q=chemistry
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Jadual waktu + konflik
GET {{base}}/v1/timetable
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Cuba tambah sesi yang bertembung (akan dijawab 409 + butiran konflik)
POST {{base}}/v1/timetable/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "day": "Mon", "start": "08:00", "classId": "<ID kelas dari GET /v1/classes>", "roomId": "Room 204" }

### Laporan beban kerja (CSV)
GET {{base}}/v1/reports/wl?format=csv
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Dashboard guru (log masuk sebagai sarah.m@campusos.io dahulu)
GET {{base}}/v1/me/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
